## [EN] Key Findings
- Qwen3.5-0.8B / wikitext2: fp baseline mean NLL 2.772 (3 seeds, 10 docs per seed).
- state 4-bit (KV fp): +1.488 nats over fp (95% CI +1.416~+1.566).
